ware: with the machines come the island\u2019s mutated creatures, awakened and ready to tear apart anything in their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.poster.avif?t=1766277271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.webm?t=1766277271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.mp4?t=1766277271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUMANITY\u2019S LAST HOPE</strong><br>Uncover the dark truths of Outbreak Island \u2014 and perhaps you\u2019ll become the last hope to save humanity from a looming catastrophe.</p>","developers":["Tiny Magicians"],"dlc":[4090460],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/3ce005e7af4cbaa44d2907b759ec238a615027f4/header.jpg?t=1766277271","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1442530/121341411/10a932c841b34299fc66b84ee9a7993c9397e0ca/1760713787/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761060915","dash_h264":"https://video